\newlabel{fig:ep_mean}{{8}{9}{Training convergence and peak performance for MLP and 1DCNN architectures. Solid lines represent the exponential moving average (EMA, $\alpha =0.8$) of episode mean reward across all seeds. Shaded regions denote standard deviation ($\pm 1\sigma $), while faint trajectories correspond to individual runs. Vertical markers indicate peak performance checkpoints.\relax }{figure.caption.10}{}}
