\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces Spatiotemporal heatmap of steering action offsets for MLP (left) and 1DCNN (right) across varying heading (H) and wind (W) conditions. The color gradient represents the difference between consecutive actions ($\Delta a_t = a_t - a_{t-1}$), where 0 (white) indicates a maintained course and 2 (dark red/blue) indicates maximum rudder deflection.\relax }}{12}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:offsetmap}{{11}{12}{Spatiotemporal heatmap of steering action offsets for MLP (left) and 1DCNN (right) across varying heading (H) and wind (W) conditions. The color gradient represents the difference between consecutive actions ($\Delta a_t = a_t - a_{t-1}$), where 0 (white) indicates a maintained course and 2 (dark red/blue) indicates maximum rudder deflection.\relax }{figure.caption.14}{}}
