\newlabel{fig:2dtrajectory}{{12}{13}{Distribution of action offsets ($\Delta a_t$) for MLP and 1DCNN across all test cases. The 1DCNN's distribution is more concentrated around zero, indicating smoother control, while the MLP exhibits a wider spread, reflecting higher jitter.\relax }{figure.caption.15}{}}
